ul Chemicals Removed from Products Often Replaced with Something as Bad or Worse</span></span><span class="text-node">.” </span><i><span class="text-node">Harvard News</span></i><span class="text-node">. </span><span class="day"><span class="text-node">25</span></span><span class="text-node"> </span><span class="month"><span class="text-node">January</span></span><span class="text-node">. </span><a target="_blank" href="http://www.hsph.harvard.edu/news/hsph-in-the-news/harmful-chemicals-removed-from-products-often-replaced-with-something-as-bad-or-worse/">https://www.hsph.harvard.edu/news/hsph-in-the-news/harmful-chemicals-removed-from-products-often-replaced-with-something-as-bad-or-worse/</a><span class="text-node">.</span></p><ul class="citationActions"><div class="debug" style="display: none"><mixed-citation publication-type="web" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:ifp="http://www.ifactory.com/press"><person-group person-group-type="author"><string-name name-style="western"><surname>Allen</surname>, <given-names>Joseph.</given-names></string-name></person-group> <year>2017</year>. “<article-title>Harmful Chemicals Removed from Products Often Replaced with Something as Bad or Worse</article-title>.” <source></source>Harvard News. <day>25</day> <month>January</month>. <ext-link xlink:href="http://www.hsph.harvard.edu/news/hsph-in-the-news/harmful-chemicals-removed-from-products-often-replaced-with-something-as-bad-or-worse/" ext-link-type="uri" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink">https://www.hsph.harvard.edu/news/hsph-in-the-news/harmful-chemicals-removed-from-products-often-replaced-with-something-as-bad-or-worse/</ext-link>.</mixed-citation>)| false</div><li><a href="http://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?title=Harmful+Chemicals+Removed+from+Products+Often+Replaced+with+Something+as+Bad+or+Worse&amp;author=Joseph.+Allen&amp;publication_year=2017" class="googleScholar c-Button--link" title="Search for this citation in Google Scholar. Opens